{"id":"2288f41c38b2dcba","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bpl-rl.md","title":"有界误差与单侧误差随机对数空间","display":"df-bpl-rl — 有界误差与单侧误差随机对数空间","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bpl-rl","aliases":["28-df-bpl-rl"],"display":"df-bpl-rl — 有界误差与单侧误差随机对数空间","depends_on":["[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, §7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.7 Definition 7.18; explicit local total-machine representation","source_printed_pages":"125,139","source_pdf_pages":"151,165","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"revision":"R5"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bpl-rl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bpl-rl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bpl-rl — 有界误差与单侧误差随机对数空间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8330fa9041fa77ae\" href=\"?note=8330fa9041fa77ae\" title=\"28-df-randomized-space-machine\">28-df-randomized-space-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, §7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.7 Definition 7.18; explicit local total-machine representation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125,139"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151,165"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTM}\">\\(\\mathsf{RTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halt}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Halt}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RSpace}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{RSpace}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8330fa9041fa77ae\" href=\"?note=8330fa9041fa77ae\" title=\"28-df-randomized-space-machine\">28-df-randomized-space-machine</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。本节点采用所有随机分支均在有限共同界内停机的总机器约定；工作空间按曾访问格数计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RTM}:\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RTM}:\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BPL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)=0]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{RL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)=0]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.18 的两类及2/3阈值；在本目录显式采用总机器，未把“几乎必停但可能有无限分支”的额外模型混入定义。</p>\n<p>这个约定也兼容通常的多项式时间/对数空间表示：固定输入的对数空间机只有多项式多个配置。若可达非停机配置存在有向环，选择环上相应硬币就能生成任意长不停机前缀，违背Halt；故所有路径长度小于配置数。反方向，多项式时间界可用一个对数空间倒计时器显式截断并拒绝，保持原有保证。上述说明没有增加Assertion所需前提。</p>\n<p>来源：§7.7 Definition 7.18，印刷139 / PDF165；机器空间约定§4.1。检索范围为本书基线原子和本轮新增计划；此前没有BPL/RL接口，故补建；不依赖其他书籍原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-randomized-space-machine","status":"resolved","id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-randomized-space-machine","status":"resolved","id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathsf{RTM}$、$\\operatorname{Halt}_M$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_M$、$\\operatorname{RSpace}_M$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RTM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halt}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RSpace}_M","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{RTM}:\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ [\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{RSpace}_M(x)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(|x|+2)\\rceil]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\le1/3]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RL}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{LogRTM}\\ [\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_M(x)=0]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2376,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-306","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"}],"outgoing":["8330fa9041fa77ae"]}